MissionControl — GameSir G7 Pro (HOS 17 / AMS 1.6.2) fork
==========================================================

This repository is a fork of ndeadly/MissionControl
(https://github.com/ndeadly/MissionControl), licensed under the
GNU General Public License version 2. See LICENSE.

Upstream base: v0.10.0 (commit 38c9879), the last official release
that matches Nintendo Switch firmware 17.0.1 and Atmosphère 1.6.2.

This fork is not affiliated with ndeadly, Nintendo, or GameSir.
Do not install this build on Atmosphère 1.12 / HOS 23.x (that stack
needs official Mission Control 0.16.0).

Added/changed in this fork (GPL-2.0 source):
- Identify GameSir devices (VID 0x3537 / name) before Nintendo names
- GameSir G7 Pro Bluetooth HID mapping: report 0x07, Home 0x02,
  Capture/Share keyboard 0x01 PrintScreen, optional rumble/IMU

Firmware images, decrypted app.bin, and vendor UWP packages are
NOT part of this source release (third-party copyright).
